#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt11Intro"
msgid ""
"I want to see GROUDON, too, but they\n"
"won't let me see even its tail…\p"
"It's got me feeling really frustrated.\p"
"Oh, no!\n"
"I blabbed about GROUDON!$"
msgstr ""
"我也想看看固拉多，\n"
"可是他们连它的尾巴都不让我看……\p"
"真让人郁闷。\p"
"糟糕！我把固拉多的事说漏嘴了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:134
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt11Defeat"
msgid ""
"I guess it's impossible to win if one\n"
"doesn't have a calm mind…$"
msgstr "看来心不静的话，是不可能赢的……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:138
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt11PostBattle"
msgid "I wonder if GROUDON even has a tail?$"
msgstr "固拉多到底有没有尾巴呢？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:141
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt12Intro"
msgid ""
"Fuhahaha!\n"
"Soon! Very soon!\l"
"Our grand objective will be achieved!$"
msgstr ""
"呼哈哈哈！快了！马上就要！\n"
"我们伟大的目标就要实现了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:146
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt12Defeat"
msgid ""
"Grrr…\n"
"I've come so far, but now this?$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜……我都走到这一步了，\n"
"现在竟然这样？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:150
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt12PostBattle"
msgid ""
"MAXIE, sir!\n"
"An intruder is headed your way!$"
msgstr "赤焰松大人！有入侵者朝您那边去了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:154
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13Intro"
msgid ""
"You're not finished yet!\n"
"You're not getting by me easily!$"
msgstr "你还没完呢！可别想轻易从我这里过去！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13Defeat"
msgid "Was I that easy to knock down?$"
msgstr "我就这么容易被打倒吗？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:161
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13PostBattle"
msgid "C-come on, one more match…$"
msgstr "再、再来一场嘛……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:164
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaIntro"
msgid ""
"Hehehe!\n"
"You made it this far, so I'll tell you!\p"
"That's right!\n"
"Up ahead, GROUDON is sleeping!\p"
"MAXIE went to GROUDON just seconds\n"
"ago!\p"
"It's going to awaken real soon!\n"
"Hehe! Hehehe!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿嘿！你都走到这里了，\n"
"我就告诉你吧！\p"
"没错！前面沉睡着固拉多！\p"
"赤焰松刚刚去了固拉多那里！\p"
"它马上就要苏醒了！嘿嘿！嘿嘿嘿！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:174
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Taken down again…\n"
"Hehe…$"
msgstr "又被打倒了……嘿嘿……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"…And while you wasted time with me,\n"
"MAXIE should have awakened GROUDON…$"
msgstr ""
"……就在你和我浪费时间的时候，\n"
"赤焰松应该已经唤醒固拉多了……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:182
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieAwakenGroudon"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: GROUDON…\p"
"Nothing could awaken you from your\n"
"sleep bathed in magma…\p"
"This BLUE ORB is what you sought.\n"
"Wasn't it?\p"
"I have brought you the BLUE ORB.\n"
"Let its shine awaken you!\p"
"And show me…\n"
"Show me the full extent of your power!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：固拉多……\p"
"沐浴在岩浆中沉睡的你，\n"
"什么都无法唤醒……\p"
"这颗靛蓝色宝珠才是\n"
"你追求的东西。对吧？\p"
"我把靛蓝色宝珠带来了。\n"
"让它的光芒唤醒你吧！\p"
"然后让我看看……\n"
"让我看看你全部的力量吧！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:193
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieGroudonWhatsWrong"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: GROUDON!\n"
"What's wrong?\p"
"Wasn't the BLUE ORB the key?\p"
"GROUDON!\n"
"Where have you gone…$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：固拉多！怎么了？\p"
"靛蓝色宝珠不是关键吗？\p"
"固拉多！你去哪里了……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:200
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieOhItWasYou"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: Oh, so it was you?\p"
"I've seen you poking around uninvited\n"
"here and there…\p"
"I get it now!\n"
"You must have pulled a cheap stunt!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：哦，原来是你？\p"
"我看到过你不请自来，到处打探……\p"
"我明白了！\n"
"一定是你耍了什么卑鄙的手段！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:207
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieDefeat"
msgid ""
"What makes you so adept at handling\n"
"POKéMON?$"
msgstr "你为什么这么擅长驾驭宝可梦？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc:211
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieImGoingAfterGroudon"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: There has to be some reason\n"
"why GROUDON fled…\p"
"That's what you're trying to say,\n"
"aren't you?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Humph…\n"
"You think I didn't know that?\p"
"With GROUDON gone, there is no longer\n"
"any need for this blasted volcano.\p"
"I am going after GROUDON, so this\n"
"is where we part!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：固拉多逃走一定是有原因的……\p"
"你想说的就是这个，对吧？\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"哼……你以为我不知道吗？\p"
"固拉多已经离开，\n"
"这座可恶的火山也就没有用处了。\p"
"我要去追固拉多，我们就在这里分别吧！$"
